        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    Validates AWS SRA Account-Level Security Controls:\n",
        "    1. Enforces Secrets Manager with automatic rotation (no hardcoded credentials).\n",
        "    2. Validates KMS vs CloudHSM cryptographic selection based on compliance tier.\n",
