        "class AWSSRAIAMAccessAnalyzerValidator:\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    Validates AWS SRA Chapter 33 (IAM Access Analyzer):\n",
        "    1. Simulates Custom Policy Checks: CheckNoNewAccess & CheckAccessNotGranted.\n",
        "    2. Enforces manual review gate for Policy Generation gaps (PassRole & S3 Data Events).\n",
