        "class AWSSRAArtifactGovernanceValidator:\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    Validates AWS SRA Chapter 39 (AWS Artifact - Security OU Implementation):\n",
        "    1. Blocks Management Account usage for compliance report downloads (Separation of Duties).\n",
        "    2. Enforces dedicated IAM Roles in Security Tooling or Security Audit Account (since native Delegation is unsupported).\n",
