        "class AWSSRASecurityLakeGovernanceValidator:\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    Validates AWS SRA Chapter 48 (Amazon Security Lake - Log Archive Governance):\n",
        "    1. Enforces Data Export & Residency compliance verification before enabling Rollup Regions.\n",
        "    2. Blocks direct human S3 bucket access; enforces Query Access via Security Tooling Subscriber.\n",
