        "                \"SRA FinOps Violation: Attach WAF/Shield ONLY at the primary entry-point resource \"\n",
        "                f\"({self.config.protected_resources_in_flow[0]}) to avoid duplicate Data Transfer Out (DTO) fees.\"\n",
        "            )\n",
        "\n",
